  "description": "industry is the published label; requests accept a label or a slug and every response echoes the label. build_stamp = sha256(workbook_sha256 + \"\\n\" + companion_sha256_or_empty + \"\\n\" + database_sha256_or_empty + \"\\n\" + payload_sha256_or_empty); workbook/companion names are relative to report_directory, database.path is relative to the project root, and no entry may carry an absolute path. A workbook this process cannot open is reported as one entry with available false and message 'Report workbook is unreadable.'; it has no hash, so workbook.sha256 and build_stamp are null - on that entry only. Every available entry carries both.",
